          "text": "BUCK_OPEN_LOOP_LOAD_STEP\n24 V synchronous buck; R: 8 -> 4 ohm at 0.5 s; PWM 1 kHz.\nRun 1 s at 100000 Hz; open the scopes.\nEquations, experiments and limits: examples/buck/README.md.\nExperimental: manual Studio workflow has not been qualified.",
